From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pannpers <pepperoni9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:50:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(login): offer no way to set a password

Liverty Music signs fans and members in with passkeys only. The hosted
login keeps password sign-in for identities that already have one, and
removes every place that sets a password:

- sign-up continues to passkey registration only (no method radio);
- the credential choice offers no Password;
- /register/password, /password/set and /password/change are not found;
- the password page offers no reset;
- registerUser refuses a password, and resetPassword, changePassword,
  checkSessionAndSetPassword and setMyPassword return an error without
  calling the API, since a Server Action stays callable without its page.
